+	// tile_base) are copied into staging memory as they are, decoded into packed rows by the tile decoder
+	// (MTLComputeTasks.h), byteswapped by the format's word size and, for depth formats, converted into their planes
+	// on the conversion kernels, then copied into dst. The same bytes as tiled_copy + upload_image. False, with nothing
+	// of dst written, when the kernels are unavailable or the format is converted texel by texel (the caller then
