+	// the 66 call sites (the wait of an SPU GETLLAR on a line a PUTLLC holds, DMA, PUTLLUC, the reservation locks of
+	// vm.cpp, the spin of shared_mutex before its kernel wait) ended within a fraction of a microsecond and the
+	// thread went on to std::this_thread::yield() (swtch_pri on Darwin, which drops its priority for up to a
